guide forever/class/warlock/imp-horde
title Imp (Horde)
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
faction Horde
levels 1-4
zone Durotar
keywords Summon Imp, Vile Familiars, Piercing the Veil, Ruzan, Zureetha Fargaze, Venya Marthand, Vile Familiar Head, Rattlecage Skull, Burning Blade Coven, Deathknell, Tainted Parchment, Tainted Tablet, Tainted Scroll, Primitive Hand Blade, Primitive Walking Stick, Warlock, class pet
reward spell 688 "Summon Imp"
